{"about_the_game":"<strong>Monster rage in HexaMon!</strong> Group four identical monsters so they merge to become a stronger monster, and keep going until they reach the highest level and vanish. Don\u2019t be fooled by how easy it looks \u2013 each level is trickier than the last. New game elements, demanding maps and a tense flood mode will have you scrambling to come up with new strategies and get the hordes of monsters under control. A fresh challenge every time, HexaMon will keep you entertained for hours on end.<br><br>Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>35 thrilling levels\t<br></li><li>More than 1000 levels in free mode\t<br></li><li>Cute monsters infront of hand painted backdrops\t<br></li><li>Tons of objectives\t<br></li><li>Lively music for a cheerful mood</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"37277b960b29e05bbc352aec8a785a72a1d8fdba.jpg","localized_name":"First monster slayed","name":"First monster slayed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/743480/37277b960b29e05bbc352aec8a785a72a1d8fdba.jpg"},{"icon":"5c17978cc0cce0a605f31d7c8256f18a3f31e01b.jpg","localized_name":"101 of monsters","name":"101 of monsters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/743480/5c17978cc0cce0a605f31d7c8256f18a3f31e01b.jpg"},{"icon":"72118c912992ca0ec1dfb2b67de5769607a6edca.jpg","localized_name":"1001 nightmares","name":"1001 nightmares","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/743480/72118c912992ca0ec1dfb2b67de5769607a6edca.jpg"},{"icon":"3eefe1fb673727b08c756caed583f1d9e2736a2c.jpg","localized_name":"Learning by defeat","name":"Learning by defeat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/743480/3eefe1fb673727b08c756caed583f1d9e2736a2c.jpg"},{"icon":"ef717f440eb58a36ab0ede45da98d49919b134c9.jpg","localized_name":"We'll be back","name":"We'll be back","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/publi